{"total": 136.344, "lines": [{"cap": "No dia em que os mortos puderam ligar por um minuto, o meu celular tocou. Na tela, tava escrito: Vovô.", "start": 0.36, "end": 7.312, "audio_at": 0.3, "dur": 7.1924589999999995, "words": [{"text": "No", "start": 0.36, "end": 0.518}, {"text": "dia", "start": 0.53, "end": 0.712}, {"text": "em", "start": 0.724, "end": 0.797}, {"text": "que", "start": 0.809, "end": 0.894}, {"text": "os", "start": 0.906, "end": 1.003}, {"text": "mortos", "start": 1.015, "end": 1.428}, {"text": "puderam", "start": 1.44, "end": 1.719}, {"text": "ligar", "start": 1.731, "end": 2.083}, {"text": "por", "start": 2.095, "end": 2.253}, {"text": "um", "start": 2.265, "end": 2.338}, {"text": "minuto", "start": 2.35, "end": 2.787}, {"text": "o", "start": 3.006, "end": 3.103}, {"text": "meu", "start": 3.115, "end": 3.285}, {"text": "celular", "start": 3.297, "end": 3.782}, {"text": "tocou", "start": 3.794, "end": 4.195}, {"text": "Na", "start": 5.031, "end": 5.249}, {"text": "tela", "start": 5.261, "end": 5.698}, {"text": "tava", "start": 5.88, "end": 6.123}, {"text": "escrito", "start": 6.135, "end": 6.584}, {"text": "Vovô", "start": 6.912, "end": 7.312}]}, {"cap": "Meu avô morreu faz dois anos. E naquele dia, cada pessoa que já se foi ganhou uma ligação. Só uma. De um minuto.", "start": 8.152, "end": 17.204, "audio_at": 8.092, "dur": 9.291958, "words": [{"text": "Meu", "start": 8.152, "end": 8.407}, {"text": "avô", "start": 8.419, "end": 8.674}, {"text": "morreu", "start": 8.686, "end": 9.026}, {"text": "faz", "start": 9.038, "end": 9.318}, {"text": "dois", "start": 9.33, "end": 9.524}, {"text": "anos", "start": 9.536, "end": 10.046}, {"text": "E", "start": 10.882, "end": 10.979}, {"text": "naquele", "start": 10.991, "end": 11.367}, {"text": "dia", "start": 11.379, "end": 11.67}, {"text": "cada", "start": 11.877, "end": 12.119}, {"text": "pessoa", "start": 12.132, "end": 12.556}, {"text": "que", "start": 12.569, "end": 12.666}, {"text": "já", "start": 12.678, "end": 12.823}, {"text": "se", "start": 12.835, "end": 12.969}, {"text": "foi", "start": 12.981, "end": 13.127}, {"text": "ganhou", "start": 13.139, "end": 13.382}, {"text": "uma", "start": 13.394, "end": 13.515}, {"text": "ligação", "start": 13.527, "end": 14.098}, {"text": "Só", "start": 14.935, "end": 15.238}, {"text": "uma", "start": 15.251, "end": 15.602}, {"text": "De", "start": 16.44, "end": 16.634}, {"text": "um", "start": 16.646, "end": 16.743}, {"text": "minuto", "start": 16.755, "end": 17.204}]}, {"cap": "Na rua, todo mundo tava no celular. A vizinha chorava falando com o marido. Um menino ria com a mãe dele.", "start": 17.844, "end": 25.513, "audio_at": 17.784, "dur": 7.9084579999999995, "words": [{"text": "Na", "start": 17.844, "end": 18.051}, {"text": "rua", "start": 18.063, "end": 18.366}, {"text": "todo", "start": 18.609, "end": 18.888}, {"text": "mundo", "start": 18.9, "end": 19.252}, {"text": "tava", "start": 19.264, "end": 19.556}, {"text": "no", "start": 19.568, "end": 19.665}, {"text": "celular", "start": 19.677, "end": 20.175}, {"text": "A", "start": 21.01, "end": 21.12}, {"text": "vizinha", "start": 21.132, "end": 21.569}, {"text": "chorava", "start": 21.581, "end": 21.969}, {"text": "falando", "start": 21.981, "end": 22.394}, {"text": "com", "start": 22.406, "end": 22.54}, {"text": "o", "start": 22.552, "end": 22.576}, {"text": "marido", "start": 22.588, "end": 23.025}, {"text": "Um", "start": 23.862, "end": 23.984}, {"text": "menino", "start": 23.996, "end": 24.36}, {"text": "ria", "start": 24.372, "end": 24.663}, {"text": "com", "start": 24.676, "end": 24.833}, {"text": "a", "start": 24.845, "end": 24.87}, {"text": "mãe", "start": 24.882, "end": 25.137}, {"text": "dele", "start": 25.149, "end": 25.513}]}, {"cap": "Eu atendi. E ouvi a voz dele: \"Oi, campeão.\"", "start": 26.253, "end": 30.341, "audio_at": 26.193, "dur": 4.328333999999999, "words": [{"text": "Eu", "start": 26.253, "end": 26.447}, {"text": "atendi", "start": 26.459, "end": 26.993}, {"text": "E", "start": 27.829, "end": 27.95}, {"text": "ouvi", "start": 27.963, "end": 28.254}, {"text": "a", "start": 28.266, "end": 28.363}, {"text": "voz", "start": 28.375, "end": 28.654}, {"text": "dele", "start": 28.666, "end": 29.031}, {"text": "Oi", "start": 29.298, "end": 29.577}, {"text": "campeão", "start": 29.771, "end": 30.341}]}, {"cap": "Eu tinha mil coisas pra contar. Que eu passei de ano. Que eu aprendi a andar de bicicleta. Que eu sentia falta das histórias dele.", "start": 31.181, "end": 40.221, "audio_at": 31.121, "dur": 9.279791, "words": [{"text": "Eu", "start": 31.181, "end": 31.351}, {"text": "tinha", "start": 31.363, "end": 31.618}, {"text": "mil", "start": 31.63, "end": 31.837}, {"text": "coisas", "start": 31.849, "end": 32.249}, {"text": "pra", "start": 32.261, "end": 32.407}, {"text": "contar", "start": 32.419, "end": 32.82}, {"text": "Que", "start": 33.656, "end": 33.753}, {"text": "eu", "start": 33.765, "end": 33.862}, {"text": "passei", "start": 33.874, "end": 34.226}, {"text": "de", "start": 34.238, "end": 34.384}, {"text": "ano", "start": 34.396, "end": 34.663}, {"text": "Que", "start": 35.5, "end": 35.634}, {"text": "eu", "start": 35.646, "end": 35.779}, {"text": "aprendi", "start": 35.791, "end": 36.216}, {"text": "a", "start": 36.228, "end": 36.265}, {"text": "andar", "start": 36.277, "end": 36.629}, {"text": "de", "start": 36.641, "end": 36.726}, {"text": "bicicleta", "start": 36.738, "end": 37.418}, {"text": "Que", "start": 38.255, "end": 38.364}, {"text": "eu", "start": 38.376, "end": 38.473}, {"text": "sentia", "start": 38.486, "end": 38.91}, {"text": "falta", "start": 38.922, "end": 39.238}, {"text": "das", "start": 39.25, "end": 39.335}, {"text": "histórias", "start": 39.347, "end": 39.869}, {"text": "dele", "start": 39.881, "end": 40.221}]}, {"cap": "Mas ele disse: \"Eu só tenho um minuto. Passa pro seu pai.\"", "start": 40.861, "end": 44.877, "audio_at": 40.801, "dur": 4.255541999999999, "words": [{"text": "Mas", "start": 40.861, "end": 41.055}, {"text": "ele", "start": 41.067, "end": 41.359}, {"text": "disse", "start": 41.371, "end": 41.783}, {"text": "Eu", "start": 41.941, "end": 42.062}, {"text": "só", "start": 42.075, "end": 42.232}, {"text": "tenho", "start": 42.244, "end": 42.487}, {"text": "um", "start": 42.499, "end": 42.596}, {"text": "minuto", "start": 42.609, "end": 43.021}, {"text": "Passa", "start": 43.857, "end": 44.209}, {"text": "pro", "start": 44.221, "end": 44.355}, {"text": "seu", "start": 44.367, "end": 44.573}, {"text": "pai", "start": 44.585, "end": 44.877}]}, {"cap": "Eu fiquei bravo. Era a minha ligação!", "start": 45.717, "end": 48.688, "audio_at": 45.657, "dur": 3.2118330000000004, "words": [{"text": "Eu", "start": 45.717, "end": 45.886}, {"text": "fiquei", "start": 45.899, "end": 46.226}, {"text": "bravo", "start": 46.238, "end": 46.651}, {"text": "Era", "start": 47.487, "end": 47.754}, {"text": "a", "start": 47.766, "end": 47.79}, {"text": "minha", "start": 47.802, "end": 48.033}, {"text": "ligação", "start": 48.045, "end": 48.688}]}, {"cap": "Eu ainda não sabia… mas aquele minuto ia mudar a minha família pra sempre.", "start": 49.328, "end": 53.297, "audio_at": 49.268, "dur": 4.208457999999999, "words": [{"text": "Eu", "start": 49.328, "end": 49.486}, {"text": "ainda", "start": 49.498, "end": 49.741}, {"text": "não", "start": 49.753, "end": 49.923}, {"text": "sabia", "start": 49.935, "end": 50.384}, {"text": "mas", "start": 50.712, "end": 50.797}, {"text": "aquele", "start": 50.809, "end": 51.161}, {"text": "minuto", "start": 51.173, "end": 51.561}, {"text": "ia", "start": 51.574, "end": 51.683}, {"text": "mudar", "start": 51.695, "end": 51.974}, {"text": "a", "start": 51.986, "end": 52.023}, {"text": "minha", "start": 52.035, "end": 52.241}, {"text": "família", "start": 52.253, "end": 52.641}, {"text": "pra", "start": 52.654, "end": 52.787}, {"text": "sempre", "start": 52.799, "end": 53.297}]}, {"cap": "Meu pai e meu avô brigaram antes dele morrer. Meu pai nunca foi no hospital. Nunca pediu desculpa.", "start": 54.137, "end": 61.186, "audio_at": 54.077, "dur": 7.289499999999999, "words": [{"text": "Meu", "start": 54.137, "end": 54.404}, {"text": "pai", "start": 54.416, "end": 54.683}, {"text": "e", "start": 54.695, "end": 54.744}, {"text": "meu", "start": 54.756, "end": 54.889}, {"text": "avô", "start": 54.901, "end": 55.132}, {"text": "brigaram", "start": 55.144, "end": 55.593}, {"text": "antes", "start": 55.605, "end": 55.884}, {"text": "dele", "start": 55.897, "end": 56.115}, {"text": "morrer", "start": 56.127, "end": 56.503}, {"text": "Meu", "start": 57.339, "end": 57.594}, {"text": "pai", "start": 57.606, "end": 57.849}, {"text": "nunca", "start": 57.861, "end": 58.237}, {"text": "foi", "start": 58.249, "end": 58.431}, {"text": "no", "start": 58.444, "end": 58.504}, {"text": "hospital", "start": 58.516, "end": 59.075}, {"text": "Nunca", "start": 59.912, "end": 60.313}, {"text": "pediu", "start": 60.325, "end": 60.604}, {"text": "desculpa", "start": 60.616, "end": 61.186}]}, {"cap": "No enterro, ele nem chorou. Ficou parado, olhando pro chão.", "start": 61.826, "end": 66.364, "audio_at": 61.766, "dur": 4.777374999999999, "words": [{"text": "No", "start": 61.826, "end": 61.96}, {"text": "enterro", "start": 61.972, "end": 62.47}, {"text": "ele", "start": 62.627, "end": 62.821}, {"text": "nem", "start": 62.834, "end": 63.088}, {"text": "chorou", "start": 63.101, "end": 63.525}, {"text": "Ficou", "start": 64.361, "end": 64.75}, {"text": "parado", "start": 64.762, "end": 65.235}, {"text": "olhando", "start": 65.417, "end": 65.818}, {"text": "pro", "start": 65.83, "end": 65.975}, {"text": "chão", "start": 65.987, "end": 66.364}]}, {"cap": "Eu corri até o quarto do meu pai. Ele tava sentado na cama, olhando pro celular dele. Que nunca tocou.", "start": 67.104, "end": 74.699, "audio_at": 67.044, "dur": 7.835666999999999, "words": [{"text": "Eu", "start": 67.104, "end": 67.286}, {"text": "corri", "start": 67.298, "end": 67.65}, {"text": "até", "start": 67.662, "end": 67.893}, {"text": "o", "start": 67.905, "end": 67.977}, {"text": "quarto", "start": 67.99, "end": 68.402}, {"text": "do", "start": 68.414, "end": 68.499}, {"text": "meu", "start": 68.511, "end": 68.681}, {"text": "pai", "start": 68.694, "end": 68.997}, {"text": "Ele", "start": 69.833, "end": 70.051}, {"text": "tava", "start": 70.063, "end": 70.282}, {"text": "sentado", "start": 70.294, "end": 70.767}, {"text": "na", "start": 70.779, "end": 70.913}, {"text": "cama", "start": 70.925, "end": 71.253}, {"text": "olhando", "start": 71.508, "end": 71.86}, {"text": "pro", "start": 71.872, "end": 71.993}, {"text": "celular", "start": 72.005, "end": 72.515}, {"text": "dele", "start": 72.527, "end": 72.879}, {"text": "Que", "start": 73.716, "end": 73.862}, {"text": "nunca", "start": 73.874, "end": 74.287}, {"text": "tocou", "start": 74.299, "end": 74.699}]}, {"cap": "\"Pai… é o vovô. Ele quer falar com você.\"", "start": 75.439, "end": 78.727, "audio_at": 75.379, "dur": 3.527375, "words": [{"text": "Pai", "start": 75.439, "end": 75.755}, {"text": "é", "start": 75.961, "end": 76.083}, {"text": "o", "start": 76.095, "end": 76.155}, {"text": "vovô", "start": 76.168, "end": 76.58}, {"text": "Ele", "start": 77.416, "end": 77.61}, {"text": "quer", "start": 77.622, "end": 77.817}, {"text": "falar", "start": 77.829, "end": 78.156}, {"text": "com", "start": 78.168, "end": 78.302}, {"text": "você", "start": 78.314, "end": 78.727}]}, {"cap": "Meu pai ficou branco. As mãos dele tremiam.", "start": 79.467, "end": 82.888, "audio_at": 79.407, "dur": 3.6608750000000003, "words": [{"text": "Meu", "start": 79.467, "end": 79.734}, {"text": "pai", "start": 79.746, "end": 79.976}, {"text": "ficou", "start": 79.989, "end": 80.304}, {"text": "branco", "start": 80.316, "end": 80.729}, {"text": "As", "start": 81.565, "end": 81.783}, {"text": "mãos", "start": 81.795, "end": 82.087}, {"text": "dele", "start": 82.099, "end": 82.354}, {"text": "tremiam", "start": 82.366, "end": 82.888}]}, {"cap": "Faltavam quarenta segundos.", "start": 83.528, "end": 85.275, "audio_at": 83.468, "dur": 1.9875830000000003, "words": [{"text": "Faltavam", "start": 83.528, "end": 84.171}, {"text": "quarenta", "start": 84.183, "end": 84.62}, {"text": "segundos", "start": 84.632, "end": 85.275}]}, {"cap": "Meu pai não conseguiu falar nada. Só chorou.", "start": 86.015, "end": 89.388, "audio_at": 85.955, "dur": 3.612334, "words": [{"text": "Meu", "start": 86.015, "end": 86.27}, {"text": "pai", "start": 86.282, "end": 86.537}, {"text": "não", "start": 86.549, "end": 86.671}, {"text": "conseguiu", "start": 86.683, "end": 87.12}, {"text": "falar", "start": 87.132, "end": 87.471}, {"text": "nada", "start": 87.484, "end": 87.836}, {"text": "Só", "start": 88.672, "end": 88.963}, {"text": "chorou", "start": 88.975, "end": 89.388}]}, {"cap": "E o meu avô disse: \"Filho… eu também te peço desculpa.\"", "start": 90.128, "end": 93.598, "audio_at": 90.068, "dur": 3.710875, "words": [{"text": "E", "start": 90.128, "end": 90.261}, {"text": "o", "start": 90.273, "end": 90.31}, {"text": "meu", "start": 90.322, "end": 90.552}, {"text": "avô", "start": 90.564, "end": 90.795}, {"text": "disse", "start": 90.807, "end": 91.196}, {"text": "Filho", "start": 91.511, "end": 91.887}, {"text": "eu", "start": 92.118, "end": 92.239}, {"text": "também", "start": 92.251, "end": 92.591}, {"text": "te", "start": 92.603, "end": 92.713}, {"text": "peço", "start": 92.725, "end": 93.052}, {"text": "desculpa", "start": 93.064, "end": 93.598}]}, {"cap": "Faltavam vinte segundos. Meu pai disse: \"Desculpa, pai. Eu tive medo de te ver morrendo.\"", "start": 94.438, "end": 101.864, "audio_at": 94.378, "dur": 7.665709, "words": [{"text": "Faltavam", "start": 94.438, "end": 95.106}, {"text": "vinte", "start": 95.118, "end": 95.421}, {"text": "segundos", "start": 95.434, "end": 96.077}, {"text": "Meu", "start": 96.913, "end": 97.18}, {"text": "pai", "start": 97.192, "end": 97.422}, {"text": "disse", "start": 97.435, "end": 97.823}, {"text": "Desculpa", "start": 98.029, "end": 98.66}, {"text": "pai", "start": 98.915, "end": 99.219}, {"text": "Eu", "start": 100.056, "end": 100.226}, {"text": "tive", "start": 100.238, "end": 100.493}, {"text": "medo", "start": 100.505, "end": 100.869}, {"text": "de", "start": 100.881, "end": 100.966}, {"text": "te", "start": 100.978, "end": 101.087}, {"text": "ver", "start": 101.1, "end": 101.294}, {"text": "morrendo", "start": 101.306, "end": 101.864}]}, {"cap": "Dez segundos. E o meu avô disse: \"Cuida do meu campeão.\"", "start": 102.704, "end": 107.072, "audio_at": 102.644, "dur": 4.607499999999999, "words": [{"text": "Dez", "start": 102.704, "end": 103.032}, {"text": "segundos", "start": 103.044, "end": 103.687}, {"text": "E", "start": 104.523, "end": 104.657}, {"text": "o", "start": 104.669, "end": 104.705}, {"text": "meu", "start": 104.717, "end": 104.948}, {"text": "avô", "start": 104.96, "end": 105.215}, {"text": "disse", "start": 105.227, "end": 105.615}, {"text": "Cuida", "start": 105.894, "end": 106.21}, {"text": "do", "start": 106.222, "end": 106.356}, {"text": "meu", "start": 106.368, "end": 106.525}, {"text": "campeão", "start": 106.538, "end": 107.072}]}, {"cap": "E a ligação caiu.", "start": 108.012, "end": 109.128, "audio_at": 107.952, "dur": 1.3565, "words": [{"text": "E", "start": 108.012, "end": 108.121}, {"text": "a", "start": 108.133, "end": 108.169}, {"text": "ligação", "start": 108.182, "end": 108.728}, {"text": "caiu", "start": 108.74, "end": 109.128}]}, {"cap": "Meu pai me abraçou tão forte que doeu. Foi a primeira vez que eu vi o meu pai chorar.", "start": 110.168, "end": 115.482, "audio_at": 110.108, "dur": 5.554082999999999, "words": [{"text": "Meu", "start": 110.168, "end": 110.459}, {"text": "pai", "start": 110.472, "end": 110.702}, {"text": "me", "start": 110.714, "end": 110.787}, {"text": "abraçou", "start": 110.799, "end": 111.236}, {"text": "tão", "start": 111.248, "end": 111.467}, {"text": "forte", "start": 111.479, "end": 111.952}, {"text": "que", "start": 111.964, "end": 112.061}, {"text": "doeu", "start": 112.073, "end": 112.438}, {"text": "Foi", "start": 113.273, "end": 113.48}, {"text": "a", "start": 113.492, "end": 113.553}, {"text": "primeira", "start": 113.565, "end": 113.941}, {"text": "vez", "start": 113.953, "end": 114.257}, {"text": "que", "start": 114.269, "end": 114.341}, {"text": "eu", "start": 114.354, "end": 114.475}, {"text": "vi", "start": 114.487, "end": 114.645}, {"text": "o", "start": 114.657, "end": 114.693}, {"text": "meu", "start": 114.706, "end": 114.875}, {"text": "pai", "start": 114.888, "end": 115.082}, {"text": "chorar", "start": 115.094, "end": 115.482}]}, {"cap": "Mais tarde, eu entendi por que o meu avô ligou pra mim, e não pra ele. Ele sabia que o meu pai não ia atender.", "start": 116.222, "end": 123.199, "audio_at": 116.162, "dur": 7.216708999999999, "words": [{"text": "Mais", "start": 116.222, "end": 116.55}, {"text": "tarde", "start": 116.562, "end": 116.987}, {"text": "eu", "start": 117.181, "end": 117.29}, {"text": "entendi", "start": 117.302, "end": 117.751}, {"text": "por", "start": 117.763, "end": 117.921}, {"text": "que", "start": 117.933, "end": 118.043}, {"text": "o", "start": 118.055, "end": 118.091}, {"text": "meu", "start": 118.103, "end": 118.273}, {"text": "avô", "start": 118.285, "end": 118.504}, {"text": "ligou", "start": 118.516, "end": 118.783}, {"text": "pra", "start": 118.795, "end": 118.953}, {"text": "mim", "start": 118.965, "end": 119.196}, {"text": "e", "start": 119.438, "end": 119.523}, {"text": "não", "start": 119.535, "end": 119.79}, {"text": "pra", "start": 119.802, "end": 120.009}, {"text": "ele", "start": 120.021, "end": 120.312}, {"text": "Ele", "start": 121.148, "end": 121.366}, {"text": "sabia", "start": 121.379, "end": 121.828}, {"text": "que", "start": 121.84, "end": 121.949}, {"text": "o", "start": 121.961, "end": 121.985}, {"text": "meu", "start": 121.997, "end":